WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.100
<v Neil Armstrong>I'm at the foot of the ladder.</v>

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:07.350
<v Neil Armstrong>The LM footpads are only depressed</v>

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:11.900
<v Neil Armstrong>in the surface about one or two inches,</v>

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.350
<v Neil Armstrong>although the surface appears to be
very, very fine-grained</v>

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.650
<v Neil Armstrong>as you get close to it.</v>

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:22.250
<v Neil Armstrong>It's almost like a powder.</v>

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.200
<v Neil Armstrong>The ground mass is very fine.</v>

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.500
[Radio static]

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:40.000
<v Neil Armstrong>Okay, I'm going to step off the LM now.</v>

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:51.000
<v Neil Armstrong>That's one small step for man,</v>

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:56.100
<v Neil Armstrong>one giant leap for mankind.</v>
